# The project .res is deliberately NOT ignored. It carries the application
# manifest (comctl32 v6 theming and the DPI-awareness declaration) that the
# .dproj settings generate, and demo/TreatmentFormDemo.dpr requires it through
# {$R *.res} — so a fresh clone has to have it in order to build.

